    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "#Project - Milestone 2\r\n\r\n**Inquiry Question**: When I use AI, who is in control — and where should I draw the line?\r\n\r\n####Write Your “Co-Creation with AI” Guidelines\r\nFollow the steps on the sketch.\r\n1. The \"Pilot Test\"\r\n2. The AI Impact Check\r\n3. Transparency Standard\r\n4. Create your “Co-Creation Guidelines” artifact in a format you choose (inspired by the Digital Gallery Walk).",
